{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"B. 结构对齐\n\n把版式对齐接到画面结构：网格、边缘、透视、建筑线、模块。\n\n找图原则：找能看见结构线的图，不只找最终美图。","x":260,"y":-180,"width":560,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"note","type":"file","file":"B_结构对齐_十元映射与参考图谱.md","x":880,"y":-170,"width":360,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"grid","type":"text","text":"网格对齐 9.5\n\nxn 9.5 / n 9 / nx 4\n\n感觉：系统、杂志、展板、UI。\n\n找图：Swiss grid、editorial grid、12-column grid、dashboard grid。","x":-640,"y":90,"width":350,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"edge","type":"text","text":"边缘对齐 8.5\n\nn 8 / x并z 7 / xn 5\n\n感觉：被边框、建筑、画面边界控制。\n\n找图：门框、窗框、柱子、画面边界、贴边构图。","x":-250,"y":90,"width":350,"height":190,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"perspective","type":"text","text":"透视对齐 8.5\n\nn 8.5 / zx 7 / xn 5\n\n感觉：空间可信、视线推进。\n\n找图：一点透视街道、走廊、楼梯、车站、消失点标注。","x":140,"y":90,"width":350,"height":190,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"architecture","type":"text","text":"建筑线对齐 8.5\n\nn 9 / xn 6.5 / zn 4\n\n感觉：稳定、结构感、场景压住画面。\n\n找图：建筑立面、哥特教堂、柱廊、城市概念图。","x":530,"y":90,"width":350,"height":190,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"module","type":"text","text":"模块对齐 8\n\nxn 8.5 / n 8\n\n感觉：信息块、栏目、卡片式排版。\n\n找图：Dashboard、角色设定页、Moodboard、作品集卡片。","x":920,"y":90,"width":350,"height":190,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"grid_ref","type":"link","url":"https://www.behance.net/search/projects/editorial%20grid%20layout","x":-640,"y":340,"width":350,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"edge_ref","type":"link","url":"https://www.google.com/search?q=edge+aligned+typography+poster+architecture+border+composition&tbm=isch","x":-250,"y":340,"width":350,"height":100,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"perspective_ref","type":"link","url":"https://www.studentartguide.com/articles/one-point-perspective-drawing","x":140,"y":340,"width":350,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"architecture_ref","type":"link","url":"https://www.google.com/search?q=architectural+line+composition+poster&tbm=isch","x":530,"y":340,"width":350,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"module_ref","type":"link","url":"https://mobbin.com/browse/web/apps","x":920,"y":340,"width":350,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"workflow","type":"text","text":"接到你的绘画流程\n\n1. 小比例定大构图。\n2. 剪影强化结构认知。\n3. 选择一种结构对齐主系统。\n4. 线稿只提高服从主系统的线。\n5. 厚涂用明暗块面强化结构。","x":-640,"y":560,"width":520,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"choose","type":"text","text":"怎么选主系统\n\n角色设定页：网格 + 模块\n叙事插画：透视 + 建筑线\n哥特/城市/废墟：建筑线 + 边缘\n训练笔记/打卡：模块 + 网格\n单人角色海报：边缘 + 中轴/网格","x":-60,"y":560,"width":520,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"image_style","type":"text","text":"按你找图的风格筛图\n\n要：结构线、辅助线、比例标注、网格、灰块、蓝图、拆解页。\n\n不要：只有氛围、只有成图、无法画出主骨架的美图。","x":520,"y":560,"width":520,"height":200,"color":"3"}
	],
